  {
   "slug": "programmes",
   "title": "Programmes",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Children are grouped by age, with small rooms, a key person for every child and plenty of time to play outside.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"ls-programs\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns ls-programs\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ls-program ls-program--red\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group ls-program ls-program--red\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Seedlings</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ls-age\"} --><p class=\"ls-age\">1 to 2 years</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>One adult for every three children. Lots of cuddles, songs, sensory play and a cosy nap room.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ls-program ls-program--yellow\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group ls-program ls-program--yellow\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Sprouts</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ls-age\"} --><p class=\"ls-age\">2 to 3 years</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>One adult for every four children. Messy play, first friendships and growing independence.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --><!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"ls-programs\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns ls-programs\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ls-program ls-program--green\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group ls-program ls-program--green\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Saplings</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ls-age\"} --><p class=\"ls-age\">3 to 4 years</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Stories, building, cooking and the garden club. Learning to share, take turns and ask big questions.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ls-program ls-program--blue\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group ls-program ls-program--blue\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Blossoms</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ls-age\"} --><p class=\"ls-age\">4 to 5 years</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>School-ready skills through play: early letters and numbers, forest mornings and big projects.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Fees</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:table --><figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Session</th><th>Per day</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Full day (7:30 to 18:00)</td><td>€62</td></tr><tr><td>Morning (7:30 to 13:00)</td><td>€38</td></tr><tr><td>Afternoon (13:00 to 18:00)</td><td>€36</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><!-- /wp:table --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ls-callout\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group ls-callout\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Meals, snacks, nappies and outings are included. Ask us about funded hours and sibling discounts.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group -->",
   "template": "page-wide",
   "featured_media": "building-blocks"
  },
  {
   "slug": "daily-schedule",
   "title": "Daily Schedule",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Our day follows a gentle rhythm. Times move a little to follow the children, and the weather, but the order stays the same.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"ls-schedule\"} --><ul class=\"wp-block-list ls-schedule\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>7:30</strong> <span>Doors open: breakfast club and free play</span></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>9:00</strong> <span>Good morning circle: songs, the weather and the plan for the day</span></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>9:30</strong> <span>Outdoor play, garden club or a walk to the park</span></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>10:45</strong> <span>Snack time</span></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>11:00</strong> <span>Room activities: building, painting, stories</span></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>11:30</strong> <span>Lunch together</span></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>12:30</strong> <span>Quiet time, naps and calm play</span></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>14:30</strong> <span>Art, music and movement</span></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>15:30</strong> <span>Story time</span></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>16:00</strong> <span>Snack, outdoor play and home time until 18:00</span></li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ls-callout\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group ls-callout\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Naps follow each child's own routine at home. Just tell us what works for your family.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group -->",
   "featured_media": "kite-sky",
   "parent": "programmes"
  },
  {
   "slug": "about",
   "title": "About Us",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Little Sprouts is a small, family-run nursery with a big garden, opened in 2011 by two early-years teachers who wanted a place where children could play outside every day.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Today we care for sixty children aged one to five, in four bright rooms, with a garden, a mud kitchen and a very popular slide.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What we believe</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Children learn best through play.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Every child deserves a key person who knows them well.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Fresh air is good for everyone.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Families are partners, not visitors.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list -->",
   "featured_media": "classroom"
  },
  {
   "slug": "our-team",
   "title": "Our Team",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Our team of fourteen includes qualified early-years teachers, nursery nurses, a cook and a gardener who is also very good at fixing tricycles.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Every member of staff is trained in paediatric first aid and safeguarding, and we spend time each term learning together.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:columns --><div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Managers</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Two founders who still spend most of the day in the rooms.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key people</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>One for every child, your first point of contact.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Kitchen &amp; garden</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Fresh food daily and a garden that grows some of it.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns -->",
   "featured_media": "our-team",
   "parent": "about"
  },
  {
   "slug": "enrol",
   "title": "Visit and Enrol",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We would love to meet you. Visits take about forty minutes, and children are very welcome.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Book a visit by phone or email.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Come and play, meet the team and see the rooms.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Join the waiting list or choose your start date.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Settling-in visits begin two weeks before your start date.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:columns --><div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Call</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>+44 20 7946 0123</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Email</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>hello@littlesprouts.example</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Visit</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>8 Orchard Road, open Monday to Friday 7:30 to 18:00</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ls-callout\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group ls-callout\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We have places for Sprouts and Saplings starting in January.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group -->"
  }
 ],
 "posts": [
  {
   "slug": "autumn-leaf-festival-recap",
   "title": "Our autumn leaf festival: lanterns, leaf crowns and a lot of soup",
   "date": "2026-10-22T15:30:00",
   "excerpt": "Thank you to every family who came along. Here is what we made, sang and ate at this year's leaf festival.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>What an afternoon! More than sixty families joined us in the garden for the autumn leaf festival, and the rain politely waited until the very last song.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The children had spent two weeks preparing: collecting leaves on our walks, pressing them in heavy books and turning them into crowns, garlands and paper lanterns.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What we did</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Made leaf crowns at the craft table</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Walked a lantern parade around the garden</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Sang the three songs the Saplings have been practising</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Shared pumpkin soup made by the Blossoms (with a little help)</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:gallery {\"columns\":3,\"linkTo\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-3 is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:leaf-festival}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:leaf-festival}}\" alt=\"Colourful autumn leaves and a paper lantern on a blue sky\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:leaf-festival}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:crayons}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:crayons}}\" alt=\"A row of chunky crayons in every colour\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:crayons}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:kite-sky}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:kite-sky}}\" alt=\"A kite with a long ribbon tail in a blue sky with clouds\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:kite-sky}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --></figure><!-- /wp:gallery --><!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>My daughter has not taken her leaf crown off since Friday. Thank you for such a lovely day.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>A Sprouts parent</cite></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Photos from the day are in your family app. If you have lost a lantern, it is waiting for you at reception.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
   "categories": [
    "events"
   ],
   "tags": [
    "autumn",
    "families"
   ],
   "featured_media": "leaf-festival",
   "format": "standard",
   "sticky": true,
   "comments": [
